The [[Lump of Coal]] is a [[Gemstone]] available in the shop for all classes, at common rarity. It is the only [[Gemstone]] which doesn't require the [[Box of Riches]], [[Shaman Mask]], or crafting to acquire. None of the effects are particularly powerful, but still, in the early game, it can fill sockets and give some space-free value.

The [[Lump of Coal]] can be lit using any [[Fire]] item, turning it into the different but arguably better [[Burning Coal]].

